The [[Galactic Empire]] operated a '''checkpoint''' on the [[planet]] [[Mapuzo]]<ref name="III" /> by [[9 BBY]]. That [[Standard year|year]],<ref name="Date">{{KenobiDate|III}}</ref> the [[Jedi Master]] [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and the [[Alderaanian]] [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] traveled with the local resident [[Freck]] to the checkpoint. However, once they arrived there, Kenobi was recognized as a fugitive and the [[stormtrooper]]s riding with them attacked the pair. After the [[Jedi]] Master had shot the troopers, he and Organa ran to the checkpoint gate and attempted to open it. When a lever did not open the gate, Kenobi shot at the control panel, which let them through. Shortly afterward, the Jedi and Organa fled the scene with the contact sent to help them off of Mapuzo, the Imperial [[captain]] [[Tala Durith]], who was an undercover [[Hidden Path]] operative.<ref name="III" />

